<ss:Cell ss:StyleID="Disclaimer" ss:MergeAcross="11">
<ss:Data ss:Type="String">As at 30th May 2014, the Benchmark converted from a gross of tax to net of tax series.  Historic performance of the Benchmark has been calculated and published on a net basis by the Benchmark provider and such data is used for the purposes of demonstrating historic performance in the “Past Performance” table.</ss:Data>
